// system-shutdown — error xp in D major, 126 BPM. Generated by MathMusic
// (style xperror, seed 2): startup → loading → error → desktop → safe mode → loading II → critical error → shutdown.
// Themes: A — Startup Sky (небо загрузки) (as written), B — Green Hill Desktop (рабочий стол) (as written); the bridge melody is newly
// composed on the rhythm of a theme from bossa. Computed parts: a counter-melody from the chords, a run up to the dominant in every build-up, the theme at half speed in the outro, a key change up.
// It is an ordinary song file: change anything; the melodies can be drawn in the piano roll (P).
// x is time in beats; n counts semitones from C4 (MIDI 60).
import { TAU, delay, exp, filter, floor, hz, mod, noise, osc, reverb, sin, smooth, supersaw, tanh } from '../src/engine.js'
